# ZSM4 - Assemble a Z80 source file

```text
B0:ZSM4 output=source
```

## Assemble

Place PROGRAM.MAC on your writable work disk and log onto that disk. The
left operand names the output and the right operand names the source.
For relocatable code use CSEG.

```text
B0:ZSM4 PROGRAM=PROGRAM
```

Check for Errors: 0 before using PROGRAM.REL. Include files resolve on
the output drive.

## Link the object

```text
B0:LINK PROGRAM[A]
```

[LINK](LINK.HLP) converts the relocatable object into PROGRAM.COM. ZSM4
uses its native V4.7 interface. Its manual accompanies the Utilities
package.
